@startuml
title Loommux Pueue Execution 生命周期
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
}

[*] --> Stashed : accepted; initial status Stashed
[*] --> Queued : accepted; initial status Queued
Stashed --> Queued : external enqueue or schedule
Queued --> Running : daemon starts task
Running --> Paused : external pause
Paused --> Running : external resume
Running --> Completed : Success
Running --> Failed : Failed / FailedToSpawn / Errored / DependencyFailed
Running --> Killed : task-specific kill reaches Done(Killed)
Paused --> Killed : task-specific kill reaches Done(Killed)
Queued --> Cancelled : adapter Remove succeeds
Stashed --> Cancelled : adapter Remove succeeds

Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Killed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Stashed
  Backend edit overlay:
  Pueue changes Stashed or Queued
  to Locked, then restores previous_status.
  Loommux only observes it;
  cancel returns cancel_blocked.
end note

note bottom of Cancelled
  No process started.
  Adapter preserves the execution record.
end note
@enduml
